// Title: Suspicious Space Characters in RunMRU Registry Path - ClickFix
// Sigma ID: 2d942aed-882b-45fd-9e23-60d2411d28e0
// Status: experimental | Level: high
// Author: Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2025-11-04 | Modified: 2026-11-06
// ATT&CK: execution, stealth, T1204.004, T1027.010
// Description: Detects the occurrence of numerous space characters in RunMRU registry paths, which may indicate
//   execution via phishing lures using clickfix techniques to hide malicious commands in the Windows
//   Run dialog box from naked eyes.
// False positives:
//   - Unlikely
// References:
//   - https://expel.com/blog/cache-smuggling-when-a-picture-isnt-a-thousand-words/
//   - https://github.com/JohnHammond/recaptcha-phish
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/7490edb4783550895f8ac7b1ff297eaa8fda0d2a/rules/windows/registry/registry_set/registry_set_susp_runmru_space_character.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language, Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.
// Note: 1 wildcard comparison(s) rewritten to 'matches regex' (KQL treats * in contains/endswith/== as a literal character)

DeviceRegistryEvents
| where (RegistryKey matches regex @"(?i)\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Explorer\\RunMRU.*$" and RegistryValueData contains "#") and (RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            " or RegistryValueData contains "            ")
